  "notes": "Keys refer to provision keys in the regulation JSON files of this directory (reg = file 'code'). Chapters 1-13 follow the Annex of IR 2024/2690 (sections 1-13), which details NIS2 Art. 21(2)(a)-(j); BSIG § 30(2) Nr. 1-10 and Cbw art. 21(3)(a)-(j) transpose Art. 21(2)(a)-(j) one-to-one (verified against the texts). The Dutch Cyberbeveiligingsbesluit art. 6-18 follow the same 13 themes (Cbb art. 18 = effectiveness, art. 17 = alerts/threat intel feeding vulnerability handling). Chapter 13 links NIS2 Art. 21(2) intro (all-hazards approach incl. physical environment) because the IR Annex section 13 cites Art. 21(2)(c), (e) and (i). Chapter 17 (OT/production) combines Störfall-Verordnung duties (§ 3(2) Nr. 3 'Eingriffe Unbefugter', § 8 + Anhang III SMS, § 9 + Anhang II safety report) with § 30(1) BSIG and NIS2 Art. 21(1)/(2). ISO27001 links are informative (titles only)."
}